-- No SELECT on the parameterized view: CREATE VIEW over it must be denied in every shape
pv in a FROM subquery: ACCESS_DENIED
pv as the table expression: ACCESS_DENIED
pv in a nested subquery: ACCESS_DENIED
pv joined inside a subquery: ACCESS_DENIED
-- Over-denial control: the same statements without the view stay allowed
granted table in a subquery: OK
-- With SELECT on the parameterized view everything is allowed
pv in a FROM subquery: OK
pv as the table expression: OK
